<p>2025 was a landmark year for Carelong. We produced over 120 million automotive and commercial vehicle parts — a new company record and a 15% increase over 2024. This milestone reflects the trust of our customers, the dedication of our team, and the continuous investment in our manufacturing capabilities.</p>

